---

## Training Loss Summary

Both models showed consistent decrease in training losses over 200 epochs:
- **Box Loss:** Decreased from ~0.08 to ~0.02 (YOLOv5x converged lower)
- **Objectness Loss:** Decreased from ~0.06 to ~0.01
- **Classification Loss:** Decreased from ~0.04 to ~0.005

YOLOv5x converged to lower loss values, explaining its higher detection accuracy.

---

## Best Model: YOLOv5x at 960 Images

- **Highest overall accuracy:** 98.4% average mAP@0.5
- **Perfect detection:** Servo Motor achieved 100% accuracy
- **Strongest class performance:** All 3 classes above 97%
- **Trade-off:** 333ms latency limits to ~3 fps (suitable for offline or batch checking)

---

## Recommendation

| Use Case | Recommended Model | Reason |
|----------|------------------|--------|
| Real-time assembly line monitoring | YOLOv5s | ~12 fps, 95%+ accuracy |
| Quality inspection (post-assembly) | YOLOv5x | 98.4% accuracy, speed less critical |
| Edge deployment (limited hardware) | YOLOv5s | Lower compute requirements |

